University of Western Australia
  On the 9th of August 2025, UWA cyber-experts detected a data-breach that resulted in the extraction of password data. The cybersecurity team at UWA responded quickly
  to the attack, locking everyone out of their accounts immediately, forcing a mass password reset. 
Smile Team Orthodontics
  In March 2026, Smile Team Orthodontics suffered a ransomware attack, which resulted in the theft of staff details, addresses and patient payment plans. All of this
  data was published to the dark web.
LexisNexis
  In March 2026, LexisNexis, an information supplier for law firms, courts and federal agencies, suffered a cloud breach, resulting in the exposure of legal and
  government client data.

